# .gitignore installed into the vault working tree by the bridge entrypoint
# (only if the vault does not already have one). The bridge container is the
# ONLY writer to this working tree.

# Obsidian per-device UI state — changes on every pane focus / cursor move.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/workspace*

# obsidian-headless writes a transient lock DIRECTORY here during `ob sync`.
# It self-heals (stale after 5s) but must never be committed.
.obsidian/.sync.lock

# obsidian-headless case-sensitivity probe. Normally created and unlinked
# within a single sync; ignored in case a crash leaves it behind.
.OBSIDIANTEST
.obsidiantest

# Obsidian trash
.trash/

# The obsidian-headless sync state (state.db, sync.log, auth_token) lives in
# $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/obsidian-headless (the /config volume), NOT in the vault —
# so there is nothing to ignore for it here. This comment documents that fact.

# Uncomment if the on-disk cache causes noisy diffs for you:
# .obsidian/cache
